LunaAgent (Beta) — macOS 13+ channel
====================================

Version: __VERSION__

What you get
------------
- Self-contained /Applications/LunaAgent.app (daemon + WireGuard helper + tools inside)
- SMAppService: login item, user agent (lunaagentd), root helper (luna-wghelper)
- Full SwiftUI UI (metrics, tabs)
- No /usr/local scatter

First launch
------------
Complete "Finish setup (Beta)": enable background services. If macOS asks, approve
under System Settings → General → Login Items & Extensions.

Uninstall
---------
Move LunaAgent to Trash. Registered SMAppService jobs go with the app.
Enrollment data may remain in ~/Library/Application Support/LunaAgent.

Docs: https://github.com/mxxnly/Luna-Agent/blob/main/docs/install-13plus.md

Do not use this package on macOS 10.14–12 — use LunaAgent_Legacy_10.14.pkg instead.
